Q37 · stage2 · N=24 candidates · K=5 targets · budget=8 (4 opening + 4 adaptive) · n=40 seeds
========================================================================================
  observed effect (random − BO)      -0.0250 evaluations
  MINIMUM DETECTABLE EFFECT          0.68 evaluations at 80% power, alpha=0.05
  => the experiment BOUNDS the effect below 0.68 evaluations.
     It does not show the effect is zero; it shows the design could not have
     seen anything smaller than that.

  the structural ceiling — a uniform draw from this menu:
    median evals to first top-5     3   (observed: BO 3.5, random 3.5)
    mean, censored at budget+1        3.978
    P(a top-5 is already in the 4-point opening) = 0.635
    P(never found in 8)              0.103
    21% of the menu is in the target set, and only 4 of 8 evaluations are adaptive.
    *** More than half the time the target is already in the SHARED opening,
        before either method has proposed anything. Those seeds carry no signal
        about the methods at all.

