========================================================================================
HOW THIS SHOULD BE WRITTEN UP
========================================================================================
  stage2: "the head start is bounded below 0.7 evaluations at 80% power"  —  NOT "BO is no faster".
  stage1: "the head start is bounded below 0.7 evaluations at 80% power"  —  NOT "BO is no faster".

  And the structural reason belongs in the same breath: a fixed menu of
  23-25 conditions with a fifth of it in the target set, at a budget of 8 of
  which 4 are a shared opening, cannot separate any two methods. Confining BO
  to the published design's own conditions also removes the capability under
  test -- it cannot propose a condition the published study never ran.

  written to results/q37-replay-power.json
